'''''Tephraciura sphenoptera''''' is a species of tephritid or fruit flies in the genus ''[[Tephraciura]]'' of the family [[Tephritidae]].<ref name="Norrbom1999">{{cite journal |last1=Norrbom |first1=A.L. |last2=Carroll |first2=L.E. |last3=Thompson |first3=F.C. |last4=White |first4=I.M |last5=Freidberg |first5=A. |title=Systematic Database of Names. Pp. 65-252. In Thompson, F. C. (ed.), Fruit Fly Expert Identification System and Systematic Information Database. |journal=Myia |date=1999 |volume=9 |pages=vii + 524}}</ref>

==Distribution==
[[Ethiopia]], [[Rwanda]], [[Tanzania]].

